#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:10
#: 0ec288588b6343f2bde9ff4ae7516f0c
msgid "1. MIT-mode force control (Panthera HT / ARX)"
msgstr "​1. MIT 力控（Panthera HT / 方舟无限）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:12
#: b98442b59e9b4f288118dee6104fba1e
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Panthera HT** and **ARX** arms. The hardware interface"
" runs a force-capable MIT configuration. The controller tracks the pose "
"with that mix of position, velocity, and effort. VR teleop is one client:"
" [VR Teleoperation](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr "在 **Panthera HT** 和 **方舟无限** 机械臂上用这一条。驱动层跑带力控的 MIT 配置。控制器用位置、速度和力矩的组合跟踪位姿。VR 遥操作是这条路径上的一种用法：[VR 遥操作](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:14
#: d052c08ad9c840c6b8ccced15939a16a
msgid ""
"**HighTorque Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**高擎 Panthera HT** — [ht-ros2-control README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:16
#: 5208e35a1d214212b78e46fa6caff320
msgid ""
"HI `control_mode:=mit` (default; the older name `full_control` is still "
"accepted)"
msgstr "驱动层 `control_mode:=mit`（默认；旧名 `full_control` 仍然可用）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:17
#: e242eb41c366436784c01a6d7501c990
msgid ""
"The driver sends position + velocity + effort + kp/kd "
"(`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`)"
msgstr "驱动下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩 + kp/kd（`pos_vel_tqe_kp_kd`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:18
#: 2989f8d50e6d4e87949dd5a6f30286e5
msgid ""
"Stiffness is the HI parameters `joint_kp` / `joint_kd` (rqt / `ros2 "
"param`)"
msgstr "刚度在驱动层参数 `joint_kp` / `joint_kd` 上（rqt / `ros2 param`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:19
#: a14b4aa307e24b02a7fe393d238b9b29
msgid ""
"Other documented HI modes: `effort` (torque only), `position` (position "
"only)"
msgstr "文档里驱动层的其他模式：`effort`（仅力矩）、`position`（仅位置）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:21
#: 42d5b5cecb8248e6ab2beb1ea99b0300
msgid ""
"**ARX arms** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限机械臂** — [arx-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control/blob/main/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:23
#: 25b6543574694123ba88ff4a40f4a632
msgid ""
"Arms use `full_control` / MIT MIX. Other `control_mode` values in xacro "
"are ignored, with a warning"
msgstr "机械臂使用 `full_control` / MIT MIX。xacro 里其他 `control_mode` 会告警并被忽略"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:24
#: c44c06fa9b9a4430a2ae3825a9d2f42f
msgid "`write()` sends position + velocity + effort"
msgstr "`write()` 下发位置 + 速度 + 力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:25
#: 3959a10eddba4d158cbf810585592eb5
msgid "MIT `kp` / `kd` come from HI `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`"
msgstr "MIT 的 `kp` / `kd` 来自驱动层的 `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:26
#: 77fd53eb6357468c9bdfd201ee42eb7f
msgid ""
"README mapping: OCS2 trajectory → position; OCS2 `future_input` → "
"velocity; OCS2 effort → gravity / static feedforward torque"
msgstr "README 映射：OCS2 轨迹 → 位置；OCS2 `future_input` → 速度；OCS2 力矩 → 重力 / 静力学前馈力矩"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:28
#: e8d86728877344bf8c55e13f88973ade
msgid ""
"**Controller** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — Interface "
"Configuration](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**控制器** — [ocs2_arm_controller README — 接口配置](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:30
#: 7fc34903572c46d49daaef1b58857cbb
msgid "The mode is auto-detected from the robot config"
msgstr "模式由机器人配置自动检测"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:31
#: e838d654402a4576a312caa8340e881e
msgid "Position-only: command `position`; state `position` + `velocity`"
msgstr "仅位置：命令 `position`；状态 `position` + `velocity`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:32
#: 704d8dbf823f48349117d33702f4c73e
msgid ""
"Force / MIX: command `position`, `velocity`, `effort`, `kp`, and `kd` are"
" all present. `[kp, kd]` is `default_gains` (HOME / HOLD) and `pd_gains` "
"(OCS2), at **Startup**"
msgstr "力控 / MIX：命令接口里 `position`、`velocity`、`effort`、`kp`、`kd` 都在。`[kp, kd]` 用 `default_gains`（HOME / HOLD）和 `pd_gains`（OCS2），只在 **Startup** 时写入"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:33
#: 31b96583d9e84275aff2d54975348426
msgid ""
"ARX documents OCS2 MIX as position + velocity + effort, with kp/kd on the"
" HI. On HT, when kp/kd stay HI parameters, OCS2 may stay in position "
"mode. Gravity compensation then uses `ht_gravity_compensation` or a "
"larger `joint_kp` (same HT README)"
msgstr "方舟无限文档把 OCS2 MIX 写成位置 + 速度 + 力矩，kp/kd 在驱动层上。高擎上，kp/kd 留在驱动层参数时，OCS2 可以停在位置模式。重力补偿用 `ht_gravity_compensation`，或把 `joint_kp` 调大（同一份 HT README）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:35
#: 2d594e3ed0194310bb08bc78db5c88ef
msgid ""
"Bring the robot up with the lean-branch `./quick_start.sh` / "
"`hardware:=real` path on [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) or [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). For the headset,"
" follow [VR Teleoperation](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr "用精简分支的 `./quick_start.sh` / `hardware:=real` 把机器人拉起来，见 [高擎 Panthera HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) 或 [方舟无限 Lift 2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。头显按 [VR 遥操作](../5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:37
#: ab416f3ffd8843d4930326e58f51962f
msgid ""
"Master–slave `mode:=mit` / `effort` on Panthera HT is [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"Panthera HT 上主从的 `mode:=mit` / `effort` 见 "
"[同构遥操作](../5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:39
#: 92828c7084a14cd5a3cb811bc81e48f2
msgid "2. Vendor joint impedance (Tianji / Rokae)"
msgstr "​2. 厂商关节阻抗（天玑 / 珞石）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:41
#: 6f23aef9b6184e788a5927eacff9985c
msgid ""
"Use this path on **Tianji** (天玑) and **Rokae** (珞石). The controller sends"
" **joint position**. Joint impedance is the vendor feature on the "
"hardware interface."
msgstr "在 **天玑** 和 **珞石** 上用这一条。控制器发送 **关节位置**。关节阻抗是驱动层上的厂商功能。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:43
#: 434db51fc65545a684809d36d1ee4b9b
msgid ""
"**Tianji** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md):"
msgstr ""
"**天玑** — [marvin-ros2-control README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:45
#: 200c9729c8364348bbe7eb2b4d4c3cca
msgid ""
"Command interface: joint **`position`**. State: `position`, `velocity`, "
"`effort`"
msgstr "命令接口：关节 **`position`**。状态：`position`、`velocity`、`effort`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:46
#: cbdee36998ce4a72be1cdec97dc3bdb8
msgid ""
"Runtime `ctrl_mode`: `POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"
msgstr ""
"运行时 `ctrl_mode`：`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / "
"`POWER_OFF`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:47
#: e665559dc66547979698b27187c102c1
msgid ""
"Joint impedance gains: `joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains` (7 values). "
"Cartesian: `cart_k_gains` / `cart_d_gains`"
msgstr ""
"关节阻抗增益：`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`（7 维）。笛卡尔：`cart_k_gains` / "
"`cart_d_gains`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:48
#: 0471f8de129a48788352b79182664899
msgid "Example: `ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"
msgstr "示例：`ros2 param set /<hardware_node> ctrl_mode JOINT_IMPEDANCE`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:50
#: bba66045ca704ca486171308262fc56f
msgid ""
"**Rokae** uses the same split: the controller sends position, and "
"compliance is the vendor hardware interface. Parameter names are in the "
"private `rokae-ros2-control` README after access. Overview: [Hardware "
"Interfaces](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)."
msgstr "**珞石** 也是这一分法：控制器发送位置，柔顺在厂商驱动层上。参数名在开通后的私有 `rokae-ros2-control` README。概览：[驱动层](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:52
#: 70197140d9e94f6eacac5d98aacca4d6
msgid ""
"Internal FA robots that use Tianji / Rokae arms are in [fa-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md). Robot IDs and launch "
"flags for that workspace are in its README after access."
msgstr "使用天玑 / 珞石臂的内部第五纪机器人见 [fa-deploy-ws 配置](../../1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。该工作区的机器人 ID 和 launch 参数在开通后的 README。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:54
#: 0926d6dbbe8843f1a5bcce635a670ce4
msgid "3. Payload identification (负载辨识)"
msgstr "​3. 负载辨识"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:56
#: aa82a9120a10427bb3390f635ff0f3a1
msgid "负载辨识 is on the Tianji / Rokae path. Run the public Tianji wizard:"
msgstr "负载辨识在天玑 / 珞石这条路径上做。运行公开的天玑向导："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:58
#: a6b0aa5c9ba7444ca9386cfa11c39748
msgid "ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard"
msgstr "ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:62
#: af3279babd5f4e71aa98261fbfb39522
msgid ""
"The program is [`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/marvin-"
"ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py), installed "
"by `CMakeLists.txt` as `tool_dyn_identify_wizard`. The banner is "
"**机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**. It connects to the Marvin controller IP, "
"collects a no-load PVT trajectory and then a loaded one, and prints the "
"10-D tool dynamics (`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`). Those values are the HI "
"parameters `left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param` on the same README."
msgstr "程序是 [`scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/scripts/tool_dyn_identify_wizard.py)，由 `CMakeLists.txt` 安装为 `tool_dyn_identify_wizard`。标题是 **机械臂负载辨识向导（工具动力学参数辨识 / CCS）**。它连接 Marvin 控制器 IP，先采空载 PVT 轨迹，再采带载轨迹，并打印 10 维工具动力学（`m, mx, my, mz, ixx, …`）。这些值就是同一 README 里的驱动层参数 `left_dyn_param` / `right_dyn_param`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/13-force_control.md:64
#: da4e57e2c8dd4effb6d0a7bbd3c41440
msgid ""
"On the MIT / OCS2 path, `[kp, kd]` is `default_gains` and `pd_gains`. On-"
"site identification for internal robots is in the private **fa-deploy-"
"ws** README after access (the default branch is typically `fa-w2`)."
msgstr "在 MIT / OCS2 这条路径上，`[kp, kd]` 是 `default_gains` 和 `pd_gains`。内部机器人的现场辨识在开通后的私有 **fa-deploy-ws** README（默认分支一般是 `fa-w2`）。"

